336
00:34:28,245 --> 00:34:31,247
Elaine, você me ama, né?

337
00:34:33,517 --> 00:34:34,584
Claro, eu te amo.

338
00:34:34,585 --> 00:34:38,821
Oh Deus.
Oh Deus, Elaine.

339
00:34:44,428 --> 00:34:45,728
Está com fome?

340
