348
00:35:34,511 --> 00:35:35,811
Wayne.

349
00:35:36,346 --> 00:35:38,347
Wayne, querido, acorda.

350
00:35:39,783 --> 00:35:41,083
Acorda.

351
00:35:42,219 --> 00:35:43,519
Wayne.

352
00:36:58,728 --> 00:37:01,497
