360
00:37:37,434 --> 00:37:40,936
<i>No fim, somos todos adubo mesmo.</i>

361
00:37:42,439 --> 00:37:44,440
<i>Tudo se recicla.</i>

362
00:37:47,844 --> 00:37:50,512
<i>Eu queria voltar a vida
